      "id": "overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "label": "Überblick",
      "title": "Lesson intro",
      "minutes": 40,
      "learn": [
        "A W-question starts with the question word: Wer, Was, Wo, Woher, Wohin, Wann, Wie, Warum.",
        "The verb stays in position 2. The subject comes next: Wo ist der Patient?",
        "Wo asks for a place. Wohin asks for a direction. Woher asks for the origin.",
        "Seit wann asks when something started. Wen asks for a person in the accusative."
      ],
