      "story": [
        "Every question word here starts with <b>w-</b>. It stands in position 1. The verb stands in position 2. The subject follows.",
        "<b>Wo</b> is a place: Wo liegt der Patient? <b>Wohin</b> is a direction: Wohin geht er? <b>Woher</b> is the origin: Woher kommt er?",
        "<b>Wer</b> asks for a person as the subject. <b>Wen</b> asks for a person as the object: Wen untersucht der Arzt?"
      ],
      "questionRule": "Position 1 is the W-word. Position 2 is the verb. Do not put the verb first in a W-question.",
